  "text": "### 5. Internal Audit Plan 2026  \n**Summary:**\nHead of Internal Audit presented annual audit plan for 2026 (5 audits planned).  \n**2026 Audit Plan:**  \n| Audit | Risk Rating | Planned Date | Expected Hours |\n|-------|-------------|--------------|-----------------|\n| Account Opening & KYC | High | Q2 | 40 |\n| Payment Processing | High | Q3 | 35 |\n| IT General Controls | Medium | Q4 | 30 |\n| Fraud Detection Systems | High | Q2 | 30 |\n| Operational Risk Mgmt | Medium | Q1 | 25 |  \n**Total Estimated Effort:** 160 hours (within budget)  \n**Committee Decision:**\n✅ **APPROVED** 2026 Audit Plan.  \n**Note:**\n- Plan flexible for emerging risks/urgent items\n- Will report quarterly on execution progress  \n**Action Items:**\n- Head of Internal Audit to provide Q1 audit update to next meeting  \n---",
